      "context": "Please enter the macOS version you want to use (default: macOS Tahoe 26): 25\n== Hardware Customization\n== Select Required Kernel Extensions\nChecking for required kernel extensions...\nNote: macOS Tahoe no longer includes AppleHDA. AppleALC needs one of these restoration methods.\n1. AppleALC + OCLP - Restores AppleHDA with a system root patch\n2. AppleALC + SimpleHDA - OpenCore injection without audio root patches"
