    {
      "prompt": "Select Intel Wi-Fi kext (default: AirportItlwm-laobamac):",
      "answer": "3",
      "context": "Select audio kext for your system: 2\n*** Found Intel(R) Wi-Fi 6E AX211 160MHz is Intel WiFi device.\nNote: Intel WiFi devices have 3 available kext options:\n1. laobamac AirportItlwm - Native WiFi on Sequoia 15.2+ and Tahoe without OCLP root patches\n2. AirportItlwm - Uses native WiFi settings menu\n   \u2022 Provides Handoff, Universal Clipboard, Location Services, Instant Hotspot support\n   \u2022 Supports enterprise-level security\n   \u2022 Requires OCLP root patches on Sequoia and Tahoe but may cause issues\n3. itlwm - More stable overall\n   \u2022 Works with HeliPort app instead of native WiFi settings menu\n   \u2022 No Apple Continuity features and enterprise-level security\n   \u2022 Can connect to Hidden Networks"
